			"hadithnumber": 2569,
			"arabicnumber": 2569,
			"text": "Ali bin Abi Talib said:“I would not pay the blood money (Diyah) for those on whom I carried out the legal punishment, except for the wine-drinker. The Messenger of Allah did not institute anything in that case, rather it is something that we would do.”",
